# DarkTrooper (REL 12), small-shot and sleep episodes (dtr6): Temple Grounds 04_temple_unknownenemies, player at
# 160 180 -39. u049d is placed at distance d with yaw y and driven into SmallShotAttack (FireSmallShot's facing,
# range and morphed arms), then morphed (press X); then Sleep/Rise repeated (the Range(0,1) < 0.5 draw picks the
# locomotion type), Decrement with no ragdoll, and Damage while the Sleep transition runs (mTransitioning).
#   BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/darktrooper.py <out> 3bfa3eff,04_temple_unknownenemies \
#     --con tools/drivers/darktrooper_smallshot.con --fast --frames 5200
@f300 god 1; give missile 50
@f302 layer 2; layer 3
@f310 tp 160 180 -39
@f330 send u049d Activate; send u0488 Activate; send u0487 Activate
@f340 send u049d Alert; send u0488 Alert; send u0487 Alert
@f500 obj u049d
@f700 fsm u049d Pursue
@f900 place u049d 160 183 -39 0; fsm u049d SmallShotAttack
@f960 obj u049d
@f970 place u049d 160 183 -39 180; fsm u049d SmallShotAttack
@f1030 obj u049d
@f1040 place u049d 160 183 -39 90; fsm u049d SmallShotAttack
